WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Messages holds chats with contacts
and a private chat for ideas.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The iteration list connects a request
to its implementation status.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
A creation session shows the agent’s work
on the requested change.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Messages version 1.13.1 adds avatar editing
to the profile editor.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Notes keeps the requests and outcomes
alongside each plugin’s version history.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Face-to-Face keeps a transcript
with each speaker’s contributions.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The Exploration Atlas collects the design
questions behind the plugins.
